reason=Implement and validate the Reportes ISCAM "Sincronizar vista" action, starting with Ventas por Periodo, and preserve the exact canonical sales logic used by the Ejecutivo report. CRITICAL SOFTRESTAURANT CONTRACT: the operational period/date selection MUST be based on turnos.apertura, not turnos.cierre. Reuse the existing canonical QUERY_SOFTRESTAURANT_VENTAS_CERRADAS_DIA / build_softrestaurant_ventas_cerradas_query from backend/modules/comercial_v2/sync_comercial_edarsahub.py; do not create a second sales query. The official contract is idempresa canonical + turnos.apertura BETWEEN inicio_operativo and fin_operativo + cierre IS NOT NULL only as closed-turn eligibility + cheques.cancelado=0; never use cierre BETWEEN/range to assign the business period. Ventas por Periodo must continue reading the canonical V2 header source dbo.vw_Comercial_KPIs_Diarios_v2_Runtime, the same lineage used by Ejecutivo, with venta principal = ventas_total con IVA, cheque_promedio = ventas_total/tickets_total and consumo/pax_promedio = ventas_total/pax_total. Audit and migrate period drilldowns (productos/tickets/tipo-servicio) away from legacy Sync_Sales when required so drill totals cannot contradict the V2 header; reuse dbo.Comercial_Inteligencia_VentasDetalleProducto or the current canonical detail source, after auditing schema. FRONTEND: add a compact "Sincronizar vista" button immediately beside Excel/PDF in ReportesISCAMPage for Ventas por Periodo, with RefreshCw/spinner state, disabled while running, clear success/error feedback, and automatic fetchReport refresh after success. The action must use the selected unidad and visible desde/hasta range. BACKEND: reuse the existing controlled scheduler/resync handler and RBAC; do not duplicate business SQL or weaken permissions. If a thin ISCAM wrapper is needed, it must delegate to the canonical resync functions/handler, preserve explicit admin permission, execute DRY RUN first, and only perform REAL resync when dry-run succeeds. For ranges larger than the canonical resync maximum, split safely into non-overlapping chunks without changing fecha_operacion semantics; fail closed if any chunk fails. After header resync, reconcile canonical detail for the same successful range so ISCAM drilldowns match the header. ACCEPTANCE CASE: ESTELAR 2026-09-01. Verify source read-only against SoftRestaurant and EDARSAHUB. The official report supplied by the user shows total con impuestos 60110.00, propina 5544.00, personas 77, cuentas 29; do not hardcode these in production logic. Validate that the corrected canonical result matches source and that ISCAM Ventas por Periodo shows the same ventas_total/tickets/pax as Ejecutivo. Add regression tests that explicitly assert apertura is the range field and cierre is only IS NOT NULL, plus tests for ISCAM source lineage and sync button wiring/RBAC. Return before/after values for 2026-09-01, exact root cause, files changed, tests/build, runtime validation, resulting Edarsahub_Desarrollo SHA, quality gate, percent complete and next step. Do not touch Edarsahub_Produccion.